	(text "Test points and mechanical (Rev A) - index\n\nTest pads sit on the sheet of the circuit they probe (REQ-T2):\n- Power tree: SYS, VBAT, 3V3_REG, +3V3, VLED_REG, VLED, GND, EN_3V3, PG_3V3, VBAT_SENSE, VLED_SENSE,\n  VBAT_MEAS_EN, PWR_SW_N\n- USB/charger/battery: VBUS, TS, QON, CHG_STAT, CC1, CC2, GND (SYS, VBAT on the power tree)\n- Debug: nRESET, SWDIO, SWDCLK and GND on the J501 pins (no UART or spare GPIO pads, DEC-017)\n- Microphone: PDM CLK/DATA.  NFC: no pads; probe C1101 (VCC), R1101 (SCL), R1102 (SDA), R1103 (FD)\n- Matrix columns: COL0, MTX_SCK, MTX_LAT\n- Matrix rows/safety: MTX_BLANK, SAFE, SCAN_OK (monostable Q), ROW0/16\nPads with no room on the routed board were removed; probe those nets at component pins.\n\nMounting holes H1301-H1303: 3 x M2 unplated for the rear carrier; positions follow the carrier design.\nRail and GND pads are 0.8 mm, the others 1.0 mm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
